WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.043 --> 00:00:04.758
Rat made some lunch for Toad.

2
00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:08.898
"Soup will help Toad feel better," he thought.

3
00:00:08.899 --> 00:00:12.804
Finally Toad came in the room.

4
00:00:12.805 --> 00:00:16.500
He looked like a real gentleman.

5
00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:22.797
Rat watched Toad sip his soup.

6
00:00:22.798 --> 00:00:25.829
"Now, Toady," Rat said,

7
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.147
"I don't want to hurt you.

8
00:00:28.148 --> 00:00:30.750
You've suffered a lot."

9
00:00:30.751 --> 00:00:35.482
"Oh yes," said Toad, nodding. "I have."

10
00:00:35.483 --> 00:00:40.610
"But," said Rat, "you are a big fool!"

11
00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:43.900
Toad dropped his spoon.

12
00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:46.294
He was shocked.

13
00:00:46.295 --> 00:00:49.827
"You were thrown in jail," said Rat

14
00:00:49.828 --> 00:00:54.179
"Yes, but—" said Toad. (I escaped!)

15
00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:58.273
"You were put in chains," said Rat.

16
00:00:58.274 --> 00:01:01.256
"Yes, but—" said Toad.

17
00:01:01.257 --> 00:01:03.933
(Not for long!)

18
00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:07.367
"You were chased," said Rat.

19
00:01:07.368 --> 00:01:10.395
"Yes, but—" said Toad.

20
00:01:10.396 --> 00:01:12.443
(I got away!)

21
00:01:12.444 --> 00:01:16.989
"You were thrown in the water," said Rat.

22
00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:19.991
"Yes, but—" said Toad.

23
00:01:19.992 --> 00:01:23.151
(I stole a horse!)

24
00:01:23.152 --> 00:01:28.174
"And all because of a car!" cried Rat.

25
00:01:28.175 --> 00:01:31.454
"Well, I . . ." said Toad.

26
00:01:31.455 --> 00:01:34.247
(It was great fun!)

27
00:01:34.248 --> 00:01:38.312
"Do you know what everyone is saying?" said Rat.

28
00:01:38.313 --> 00:01:42.482
"They're saying my friend is a thief!"

29
00:01:42.483 --> 00:01:45.603
Rat was very upset.

30
00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:48.752
"You're right, Ratty," said Toad.

31
00:01:48.753 --> 00:01:51.521
"I have been very bad."

32
00:01:51.522 --> 00:01:55.313
Toad thought for a moment.

33
00:01:55.314 --> 00:01:59.318
"I will go back to Toad Hall," said Toad.

34
00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:01.746
"And I will live quietly.

35
00:02:01.747 --> 00:02:03.912
No more adventures!"

36
00:02:03.913 --> 00:02:06.582
"What?" cried Rat.

37
00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:09.667
"Haven't you heard?"

